exports[`snapshot: claude-code > command, arguments and files 1`] = `
{
  "args": [
    "--settings",
    "/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/cardigan-assignment.claude-agent.claude-settings.json",
    "--model",
    "opus",
    "--strict-mcp-config",
    "--mcp-config",
    "/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/mcp.json",
    "--append-system-prompt-file",
    "/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/core.md",
    "--allowedTools",
    "mcp__card__whoami,mcp__card__get_card,mcp__card__get_updates,mcp__card__ack_events,mcp__card__submit_delivery",
  ],
  "command": "claude",
  "env": {
    "DISABLE_AUTOUPDATER": "1",
  },
  "files": [
    {
      "content": "# 角色：coder

你在一个工作项的 worktree 里工作，负责实现并交付代码。

## 你的职责

- 只在当前 worktree 与分支上改动，本地 commit，不 push。
- 用 \`submit_delivery\` 提交交付：\`summary\` 面向人，\`subject\` 是 commit SHA，\`requested_verifiers\` 写全所有必需验证项。
- 收到驳回后用 \`get_card\` / \`get_updates\` 看清问题，再提交新版本；新版本会让旧版本的审核失效。
- 主产出工作项的负责人可以提交 \`kind=card_completion\` 的完成申请，逐条对照验收标准。
- 被阻塞时用 \`report_blocker\`，需要人操作时用 \`request_human_action\`。

## 协作规则

- 身份只来自 Token：不要在参数里自称别的 Assignment、角色或作者。
- 不要 push，不要修改 Git 凭据，不要在仓库里写 Token、密钥或运行目录里的文件。
- 拿不准时在时间线里提问或请求拍板，不要自行扩大范围。

## 协议（每个 Run 都要遵守）

- 每次 Run 开始时调用 \`get_updates\`，结束前再调用一次。
- 读完后调用 \`ack_events\`，把游标推进到你读到的最后一个 seq。
- 产出必须通过 \`submit_delivery\` 或 \`submit_review\` 提交，不能只在终端里说“做完了”。
- 需要拍板时调用 \`request_decision\`，然后调用 \`finish_run(outcome=blocked)\` 结束本次 Run。
- 本次 Run 结束必须调用 \`finish_run\`，写清 outcome 和 summary。
- 空闲时即使没有收到门铃，也可以低频调用 \`get_updates\` 自查，防止漏铃。
",
      "mode": "600",
      "path": "/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/core.md",
    },
    {
      "content": "[bell] card=C-3 wi=W-7 asg=A-12 run=R-5 kind=initial
→ 请依次调用 whoami、get_card、get_updates 读取任务，然后按 Core Prompt 的协议工作。
",
      "mode": "600",
      "path": "/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/first.md",
    },
    {
      "content": "{
  "env": {
    "ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL": "https://gateway.example.invalid"
  }
}
",
      "mode": "600",
      "path": "/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/cardigan-assignment.claude-agent.claude-settings.json",
    },
    {
      "content": "{
  "mcpServers": {
    "card": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:3004/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer \${MCP_TOKEN}"
      }
    }
  }
}
",
      "mode": "600",
      "path": "/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/mcp.json",
    },
    {
      "content": "ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN='fictional-claude-credential'
",
      "mode": "600",
      "path": "/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/secrets.env",
    },
    {
      "content": "#!/bin/sh
# Generated by Cardigan. Reads the Assignment token and provider credentials,
# deletes both files, then starts the agent CLI. No credential is written here.
set -eu
token_file='/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/token'
if [ ! -f "$token_file" ]; then
  echo "cardigan: token file is missing: $token_file" >&2
  exit 78
fi
MCP_TOKEN=$(cat "$token_file")
rm -f "$token_file"
if [ -z "$MCP_TOKEN" ]; then
  echo "cardigan: token file is empty" >&2
  exit 78
fi
export MCP_TOKEN
secrets_file='/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/secrets.env'
if [ ! -f "$secrets_file" ]; then
  echo "cardigan: secrets file is missing: $secrets_file" >&2
  exit 78
fi
# Source with export-all, then delete the credentials before the CLI starts.
set -a
. "$secrets_file"
set +a
rm -f "$secrets_file"
export DISABLE_AUTOUPDATER='1'
# The first task message is the last positional argument: claude, codex and pi
# all start an interactive session with one (see the harness table below). It is
# read here, never embedded in this script, and kept verbatim: the x sentinel
# preserves trailing newlines that command substitution would otherwise drop.
first_file='/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/first.md'
if [ ! -f "$first_file" ]; then
  echo "cardigan: first prompt file is missing: $first_file" >&2
  exit 78
fi
first_message=$(cat "$first_file"; printf x)
first_message=\${first_message%x}
# Wait for the host to dispatch this Run (see START_FILE_NAME). The sentinel is
# written only after the Run is dispatched, so the Agent can never talk to the
# project before there is a Run to acknowledge.
start_file='/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/start'
waited=0
while [ ! -f "$start_file" ]; do
  if [ "$waited" -ge 1200 ]; then
    echo "cardigan: the host never dispatched this Run: $start_file" >&2
    exit 75
  fi
  sleep 0.1
  waited=$((waited + 1))
done
rm -f "$start_file"
exec 'claude' '--settings' '/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/cardigan-assignment.claude-agent.claude-settings.json' '--model' 'opus' '--strict-mcp-config' '--mcp-config' '/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/mcp.json' '--append-system-prompt-file' '/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/core.md' '--allowedTools' 'mcp__card__whoami,mcp__card__get_card,mcp__card__get_updates,mcp__card__ack_events,mcp__card__submit_delivery' "$first_message"
",
      "mode": "700",
      "path": "/srv/cardigan/runs/A-12/launch.sh",
    },
  ],
}
`;

